    websites, advertising and growth support. The exact scope, deliverables and timeline
    of any engagement are agreed in a separate proposal or agreement.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Quotes, fees and payment</h2>
  <p><code>[TODO: set out how quotes work, fees, payment terms, invoicing, late payment, and whether advertising spend is billed separately — note: ad spend is always paid by the client directly to the ad platform.]</code></p>

  <h2>4. Client responsibilities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide accurate information and timely feedback.</li>
    <li>Supply any access, assets or accounts needed to do the work.</li>
    <li>Ensure the materials you provide do not infringe third-party rights.</li>
  </ul>

