  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Netherlands. <code>[TODO: confirm competent court / jurisdiction.]</code></p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at {contactEmail}.</p>
</LegalLayout>
